### ==============================================================================
### CollectFlow B2B SaaS REST API Test Suite
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ HTTP Client, & Postman
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@nginxUrl = http://localhost
@javaBackendUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. DASHBOARD & FINANCIAL ANALYTICS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### GET Aggregated Dashboard Stats & Aging Buckets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET Legacy Analytics Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics
Content-Type: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. INVOICE & DEBTOR ITEMS (PAGINATION, FILTERING, SEARCH)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### GET Paginated Invoices (Page 1, Limit 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?page=1&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET Filter Invoices by OVERDUE Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?status=OVERDUE&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET Search Invoices by Debtor Company Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?search=Nova
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET Invoices List with Customer Dossiers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST Create a New Invoice Record
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust_01",
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2024-9988",
  "amount": 7500,
  "dueDate": "2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Enterprise Cloud Architecture Consulting Q3",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Cloud Security Assessment",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 4500,
      "amount": 4500
    },
    {
      "description": "Kubernetes Deployment Setup",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 3000,
      "amount": 3000
    }
  ]
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. WORKFLOW ACTION TRIGGERS & CADENCE CONTROLLER
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### POST Action: Nudge All Overdue Debtors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actions/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "NUDGE_ALL_OVERDUE",
  "channel": "ALL"
}

###

### POST Action: Apply 1.5% Late Fee to Delinquent Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actions/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "APPLY_LATE_FEE",
  "invoiceId": "inv_03"
}

###

### POST Action: Pause Cadence (Mark IN_DISPUTE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actions/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "PAUSE_CADENCE",
  "invoiceId": "inv_05"
}

###

### POST Action: Escalate Delinquent Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actions/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actionType": "ESCALATE_DELINQUENT",
  "invoiceId": "inv_07"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. AI AR COPILOT & AUTONOMOUS AUTO-PILOT DUNNING
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### POST AI Copilot Query: Who Owes the Most?
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Who owes us the most money right now?"
}

###

### POST AI Copilot Query: Draft Follow-Up Reminder Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Draft an urgent follow-up email for Apex Logistics"
}

###

### POST AI Copilot Query: Cashflow Forecast
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is our cash collection forecast and DSO for this month?"
}

###

### POST Trigger Autonomous Auto-Pilot Dunning Engine
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/autopilot
Content-Type: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. DEVOPS RESILIENCE & ANTIGRAVITY SELF-HEALING
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### POST Antigravity Self-Healing Webhook (Diagnose Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/antigravity/heal-webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commitSha": "e4f8a129d",
  "repository": "rama07091996/collectflow-saas",
  "environment": "production",
  "errorLog": "Error: Prisma schema validation - (get-dmmf wasm)\nError code: P1012\nerror: Error validating: The argument `references` must refer only to existing fields in the related model `Workflow`. The following fields do not exist in the related model: workflowId\n--> prisma/schema.prisma:210",
  "targetEmail": "admin@collectflow.io"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. JAVA SPRING BOOT & STRIPE PAYMENT GATEWAY (/api/v1/)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### POST Create Stripe 1-Click Checkout Session (Direct or via Nginx)
POST {{javaBackendUrl}}/payments/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceId": "inv_01",
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2024-001",
  "amount": 4200.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "customerEmail": "accounts@novalabs.bio",
  "customerName": "Nova Labs BioTech",
  "description": "Full settlement for Invoice INV-2024-001"
}

###

### POST Stripe Webhook Signature Verification Test
POST {{javaBackendUrl}}/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1614552000,v1=5257a869e7ecebeda32affa62cd493d8323600b7431e3e21937ecd8e62730033

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook_001",
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "cs_test_123",
      "amount_total": 420000,
      "currency": "usd",
      "metadata": {
        "invoiceId": "inv_01",
        "invoiceNumber": "INV-2024-001"
      }
    }
  }
}
